    "spell_resistance_raw": "yes (object)",
    "description_raw": "You lock a weapon in place on its owner’s body, or within the weapon’s sheath or holster. Anyone who then tries to draw the weapon must spend a standard action and succeed at a Strength check (DC equal to the saving throw DC) to do so, provoking attacks of opportunity whether the attempt succeeds or fails.\n\nPeacebond, Greater\nSource PZO1134\n\nSchool abjuration; Level inquisitor 4, occultist 4, psychic 5, sorcerer/wizard 5, witch 5",
